; The zone of the DNS lab (documentation names and addresses: example.test, RFC 5737).
; Every TTL is 5 seconds, so that smoke.sh sees an entry expire, and serve-stale answer,
; within seconds. The SOA's last field, the negative TTL (RFC 2308), is 5 seconds as well.
$TTL 5
@       IN SOA  ns.example.test. hostmaster.example.test. (
                1       ; serial
                3600    ; refresh
                600     ; retry
                86400   ; expire
                5 )     ; negative caching TTL
        IN NS   ns.example.test.
ns      IN A    203.0.113.2
bind    IN A    203.0.113.2
www     IN A    192.0.2.10
api     IN A    192.0.2.11
